# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""The production and arrangement page, guitar first, in the four languages of the site.

Facts come from Angelo (November 2026): twelve years of guitar, twenty of piano, music theory and piano at the
Conservatorio Benedetto Marcello in Venice, productions, more than fifteen years full time in the studio.
The instruments are his own: a 2025 Gibson Les Paul Standard '60s in Iced Tea with Gibson Custombuckers in place of
the stock Burstbucker 61s, a 2026 Fender American Professional Stratocaster (Olympic White, rosewood, mint pickguard,
V-Mod III) and a Fender Telecaster Thinline (Modern Player series, not named on the page) with Lollar P-90s.
The red Telecaster FMT HH is being sold and is not listed. Specs of each model checked against the makers' published specs.
Guitar amps are UAD and Neural DSP emulations and are listed as emulations. The outboard is the chain Angelo describes.
Only gear Angelo owns goes on this page, named as it is: no reissue model names, no plugins presented as hardware.

GEAR_TODO: microphones, preamps and conversion, pedals and monitoring are not known yet.
Their rows in the tech specs stay empty, and empty rows are not rendered: fill them when Angelo sends the list.
"""

